 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, use the given stock table to answer the following:\n<ol type=\"a\">\n<li>What was the 52-week low?</li>\n<li>What was the dividend?</li>\n<li>What is its year-to-date performance?</li>\n<li>What is its yield?</li></ol>",
